{{inh+|fr|frm|debte}} (with silent ''b''), from {{inh|fr|fro|dete}}, from {{inh|fr|VL.||*depta}}, from {{inh|fr|la|dēbita}}, plural of {{m|la|dēbitum}}. {{doublet|fr|débit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr|Fr-dette.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|f}}

# [[debt]]
#: {{coordinate terms|fr|créance}}

====Usage notes====
* While both {{m|fr||dette}} and {{m|fr|créance}} correspond to {{m+|en|debt}}, {{m+|fr||dette}} is seen from the perspective of the borrower (money they owe), whereas {{m|fr||créance}} is seen from the perspective of the lender (money owed to them).

